<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Sun Ray</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 31, up to 80%), Druid (guild level 41, up to 80%)
Mana: 25
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast sun ray &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Calls down a ray of burning sunlight on the target. It needs the sun: you 
must be outdoors, under a cloudless sky, in the daytime (from five in the 
morning until nine at night). It is weak in the early morning and late 
evening, and strongest at high noon. It burns the undead far worse than the 
living.
</p><p>A shield can block it. It does best against clothes and less the heavier the 
armour. Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. To clear the sky first, 
see <a cmd='#'>Help Clear Skies</a>. It can be cast while fighting. It is also found on wands, staffs and scrolls. Practising 
it needs divine 62.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clear Skies</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sun Beam</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Weather</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fire Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>